source: app.rs
expression: "render(|origin| rsx! { IndexPage { origin } }, origin)"
---
<div class="intxt-page"><header class="intxt-bar"><h1>intxt</h1></header><main><p>A read-only viewer of intxts, served at <code>/i/&#60;drawer id&#62;?via=&#60;node key&#62;</code>.</p><p>No node is configured (INTXT_WEB_NODE and its capabilities are unset), so every page is the built-in fixture. Example: <a href="/i/z11111111111111111111111111111111">/i/z11111111111111111111111111111111</a></p></main></div>
